- Duplicate logic is spread across three functions each doing full `findAll()` scans; `OwnerRepository` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/.../repository/OwnerRepository.java`) exposes only `findByLastName`, `findById`, `findAll`, `save`, `delete` — no query-by-key method, so a consolidated `identityKey` check would still scan `findAll()` unless the repository/entity is extended.
